  "toneGuideTitle": "Guide to Thai tones",
  "toneGuideHeading": "About Thai tones",
  "toneGuideIntro": "Thai has five tones, and changing the tone can change a word's meaning. Tone is determined by consonant class (high, mid, or low), tone mark, and syllable type.",
